## Subscriptions (WebSocket, graphql-ws)

```graphql
subscription {
  sessionUpdated(sessionID: "SESSION_ID") {
    battery maxBattery score victory gameOver totalMoves message mapName
    playerPos { x y }
    nearbyGrid { type visited id allowedDirections }
    currentMoves { fromPosition { x y } toPosition { x y } success }
  }
}
```

```graphql
subscription {
  lobbyUpdated { battery score victory gameOver mapName playerPos { x y } }
}
```

URL: `{{.WSURL}}/graphql`.

